msgstr ""

msgid "Ami「..................」"
msgstr "Ami「..................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kawashima? What's wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Kawashima? ¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ami「Oh......」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"Oh\"?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿\"Ah\"?」"

msgid "Ami「N-Nothing!!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡¡N-Nada!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It sure doesn't seem like nothing. Your＿face is red. Do you have a fever? Let's＿see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pues no parece que no sea nada.＿Tienes la cara roja. ¿Tienes＿fiebre? A ver......」"

msgid "Ami「Aaahh!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Aaahh!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Don't freak out. I'm just checking if＿you have a fever.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No te alteres. Solo estoy＿viendo si tienes fiebre.」"

msgid "Ami「S-Shut it! I didn't scream! And I don't＿have a fever!!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡C-Cállate! ¡No grité!＿¡¡Y no tengo fiebre!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's the matter with you,＿Kawashima?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué te pasa, Kawashima?」"

msgid "Ami「........................」"
msgstr "Ami「........................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kawashima?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Kawashima?」"

msgid "Ami「......Forget it. When I'm with you...... I＿start feeling restless.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Olvídalo. Cuando estoy＿contigo...... me empiezo＿a sentir inquieta.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Eh?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（\"Restless\"? I thought we were talking＿just fine for a while there. I just don't＿get her.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿\"Inquieta\"? Pensé que estábamos＿hablando bastante bien hace un rato.＿Simplemente no la entiendo.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Guess I have no choice but to check＿out the sauna.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Supongo que no me queda otra＿que ir a ver la sauna.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Wow, so this is what a cold sauna's like.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Vaya, así que así es una sauna fría.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（A guy could really lose track of time in＿here......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Uno de verdad podría perder la noción＿del tiempo aquí dentro......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「*Yawn*......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「*Bostezo*......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「........................................................................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「....................................＿....................................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Huh? Crap, I totally passed out.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......¿Eh? Rayos, me quedé＿totalmente dormido.）」"

msgid "Ami「I'm going to find Maya-chan and＿Nanako-chan. I think their＿aromatherapy massages should be」"
msgstr "Ami「Voy a buscar a Maya-chan y a＿Nanako-chan. Creo que sus masajes de＿aromaterapia ya deben estar」"

msgid "Ami「ending right about now. Bye.」"
msgstr "Ami「terminando ahora. Adiós.」"
